  "question": "Which gallery can I find inside 100 kilometers on the way to Al Capone's House, Chicago, IL from Algonquin Woods, IL?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-87.872175 42.023616)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-87.618785 41.762502)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE tourism = 'gallery'\nAND ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-87.872175 42.023616)',4326)::geography, 100000)\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-87.872175 42.023616)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5);\n",
